ENGLISH
===========================================================================

What Vekirion AiO changes: the list of mods and changed files is in
MT2009_Gotowe/CZYTAJ.txt and MT2009_Luzne_pliki/CZYTAJ.txt, and the exact
changes against MT2009 PLUS (client 2.0.66, server 2.35.0) in the *.diff and
*.patch files (MT2009_Luzne_pliki/wszystko/ and mody_osobno/). The changed
places in the code carry MT2009_PLUS_* markers.

In short (the licence text is what binds): you may copy, share and modify this
package, publicly too, provided that:
  - you credit the authors (Vekirion, ZAXEP/SIZOWSKI, Tieru) with the links
    above, and say what you changed in a modified version;
  - you do not use it for commercial purposes;
  - you share a modified version under the same licence.

How to credit:
  Vekirion AiO - Vekirion - based on MT2009 PLUS (ZAXEP/SIZOWSKI,
  https://github.com/zaxerrrr-dot/mt2009-sp-plus) and Metin2 Playerbots (Tieru,
  https://github.com/TieruYT/metin2-playerbots) - CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

The licence covers the authors' work: code, scripts, installers, data,
graphics and documentation. It does not cover Metin2 (Ymir Interactive,
Webzen), the server-file packages, third-party libraries or parts that carry a
licence of their own. The client and server files in this package are MT2009
PLUS files with this package's changes - their parts that come from MT2009 PLUS
and Metin2 Playerbots stay under those projects' terms (below).

